<title>USA: PanEnergy Corp Q4 net eased after charge.</title>
<headline>PanEnergy Corp Q4 net eased after charge.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.51		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			 76,700		   78,400</p>
<p> Revs		   2,556,100		1,318,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 151,100		  150,100</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.28		    $2.03</p>
<p> Net			344,400		  303,600</p>
<p> Revs		   7,536,800		4,967,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 150,900		  149,700</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call Q4 consensus estimate was $0.59. Company earned $0.62 before charges in the quarter and $2.39 in all of 1996.</p>
<p>1996 net includes charge of $17 million, or $0.11/shr, for debt redemption and expenses of $7.6 million for pending merger with Duke Power Co.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
